&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1OR1PXsLV3XWZSJw1CzzElIU2AVZdALzQNjlkCIuQBlA&oe=69DCFC0C"}, "display_name": "Catastrophic Inversion", "keywords": ["Arena", "Laser", "Cyber", "Huge", "Neon"], "long_description": "**Catastrophic Inversion** is the multiplayer shooter for large spaces. After a quick mapping of your space, it accurately aligns all players, allowing you to move around together in the same space.\n\n**TRANSFORM YOUR SPACE INTO A MULTI-LEVEL VR BATTLEGROUND**\n{1969331173680063}\n**FIGHT YOUR FRIENDS IN A GROWING COLLECTION OF PVP ARENAS**\n{942912398100454}\n**EXPLORE AND SURVIVE TOGETHER (OR ALONE) IN ADVENTURE MODE**\n{881509854914158}\n**Quick Notes:**\n- Most maps require 24x14m (79x46') to play in shared-space. There are also some 10x10m (33x33') maps. Stationary / room-scale play available for all maps.\n- Dedicated host & spectator available on PC. Hosting from the PC version is recommended (but not required) for multiplayer.\n- Games auto-connect over Wi-Fi on your local network. There are currently no official online servers, but peer-to-peer online games are possible.\n\nSee our website for the latest info.", "short_description": "Transform your space into a multi-level VR battleground!\n\nCatastrophic Inversion is the multiplayer shooter for large spaces. Accurately aligning all players, it allows you to move among each other as you battle it out in a growing collection of PVP arenas."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://toastidwaffel.com/policies#privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://toastidwaffel.com/policies#aup", "publisher_name": "Toastid Waffel", "support_website_url": "https://toastidwaffel.com/support", "website_url": "https://toastidwaffel.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": 